<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;net8.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>CSStack.DDD</PackageId>
    <!-- The release workflow passes the version from the Git tag (-p:Version=...). This value is used only for local builds. -->
    <Version>0.0.0-local</Version>
    <Title>CSStack.DDD</Title>
    <Authors>Uta Sugane</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Uta Sugane</Copyright>
    <Description>A lightweight toolkit of building blocks for Domain-Driven Design (DDD) in C#. It provides interfaces and base classes for value objects, entities, aggregate roots, domain events, repositories and the unit of work, with no dependency on any persistence technology.</Description>
    <PackageTags>DDD;DomainDrivenDesign;CleanArchitecture;OnionArchitecture;ValueObject;Entity;AggregateRoot;DomainEvents;Repository;UnitOfWork</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Initial release (0.1.0).

Targets netstandard2.0, net8.0 and net10.0, with no dependencies on other packages or on any persistence technology.

Domain (CSStack.DDD.Domain):
- IValueObject and ISingleValueObject: value objects with equality by attributes. Implement them with records.
- IEntity and Entity: entities with equality by identifier. Equals and GetHashCode are sealed in the base class, which also provides the == and != operators.
- IAggregateRoot and AggregateRoot: aggregate roots that record domain events with AddDomainEvent.
- IDomainEvent and IDomainEventSource: domain events with an ID and an occurrence time, and a non-generic interface for collecting them from any aggregate with PullDomainEvents.
- IRepository and IDeletableRepository: repositories with FindAsync and Save, and Delete in a separate interface. Changes are applied when the unit of work commits.
- IValidatable, ValidationError and DomainValidationException: validation that reports typed errors with member paths (for example, "Address.PostalCode").
- Built-in validation errors: Required, InvalidFormat, TooLong, TooShort and OutOfRange.
- ValidationErrorExtensions: Under to prefix error paths, and ThrowIfInvalid to throw DomainValidationException when any error exists.

Application (CSStack.DDD.Application):
- IUnitOfWork: commits all registered changes in a single transaction with CommitAsync.
- ConcurrencyConflictException: a common exception for concurrency conflicts detected by the infrastructure.

Documentation: https://github.com/Uta-member/CSStack.DDD/tree/master/docs/en</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageIcon>CSStack.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Uta-member/CSStack.DDD</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Uta-member/CSStack.DDD</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true' Or '$(TF_BUILD)' == 'true'">
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild>true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="CSStack.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
